+
+The game's pk4s are rewritten once into <game folder>/prepared/: what a level
+load reads stored (not deflated), the OGG sounds that a load decodes as PCM
+WAV files, the rest copied as it is. Later starts load those pk4s instead of
+the originals, so a load converts nothing. GPLv3, as the rest of the game.
+*/
